C. PEP Initiation
1.
Ww
Pre-initiation counseling should be people-centered, discussing the following
concepts, in addition to specifications of PEP use:
Enhanced adherence counseling include baseline individual needs assessment,
counseling and education and follow-up telephone calls;
Side effects and how to address them;
Age-specific considerations for offering adherence counseling to children and
adolescents who have been sexually abused;
Use of other components of the HIV combination prevention package while on
PEP;
Transitioning to PrEP seamlessly should the person remain at substantial risk of
HIV.

